sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor UserA as Usuario A
    actor UserB as Usuario B
    participant API as Inventory Service<br/>ECS/Fargate
    participant Redis as Redis<br/>Cache
    participant DB as Aurora PostgreSQL

    Note over UserA,DB: Ambos usuarios intentan comprar el mismo asiento

    UserA->>API: POST /holds<br/>seat=A-10
    UserB->>API: POST /holds<br/>seat=A-10

    API->>Redis: Consultar disponibilidad
    Redis-->>API: AVAILABLE

    API->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    API->>DB: UPDATE seat_inventory<br/>SET status=HELD, holdId=HOLD-A<br/>WHERE seat=A-10<br/>AND status=AVAILABLE

    API->>DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    API->>DB: UPDATE seat_inventory<br/>SET status=HELD, holdId=HOLD-B<br/>WHERE seat=A-10<br/>AND status=AVAILABLE

    DB-->>API: 1 row updated
    DB-->>API: 0 rows updated

    API->>DB: COMMIT
    API-->>UserA: 200 OK<br/>Seat HELD<br/>holdId=HOLD-A

    API->>DB: ROLLBACK / no change
    API-->>UserB: 409 Conflict<br/>Seat no longer available

    Note over DB: Solo una transacción puede cambiar<br/>AVAILABLE → HELD

    UserA->>API: Confirm purchase
    API->>DB: UPDATE seat<br/>HELD → SOLD
    DB-->>API: 1 row updated
    API-->>UserA: Ticket purchase confirmed
